(4275104, 617517, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great colours.  I would love to have seen this with more depth of field, so everything was in focus.  One skittle with the rest m &amp; m''s?  How did you get the S on the smarty?  I also think that maybe a black table/paper to sit them on might have made the colour pop out more, as well as hide the shadows below them.  7</td>', 'Great colours.  I would love to have seen this with more depth of field, so everything was in focus.  One skittle with the rest m & m''s?  How did you get the S on the smarty?  I also think that maybe a black table/paper to sit them on might have made the colour pop out more, as well as hide the shadows below them.  7', '2007-11-28 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275106, 616824, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I do not care for the white frame.  For some reason the colours appear a bit dull.</td>', 'I like the concept.  I do not care for the white frame.  For some reason the colours appear a bit dull.', '2007-11-28 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275108, 616155, 23002, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  amazing what you can find by turning over one little leaf! 8</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  amazing what you can find by turning over one little leaf! 8', '2007-11-28 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275111, 616504, 23002, '<td valign="top">Love the fisheye perspective.  Hopefully not really left alone in the crowd though..so that is a bit of a stretch.</td>', 'Love the fisheye perspective.  Hopefully not really left alone in the crowd though..so that is a bit of a stretch.', '2007-11-28 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275113, 617408, 23002, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, what did he do?  I likely do not want to know!  Nice concept and colours.</td>', 'Hehehe, what did he do?  I likely do not want to know!  Nice concept and colours.', '2007-11-28 23:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275116, 615579, 23002, '<td valign="top">wow, three great dragonflies on one branch, and all in fairly good focus.  Nicely done.  The big one on the end is really huge!</td>', 'wow, three great dragonflies on one branch, and all in fairly good focus.  Nicely done.  The big one on the end is really huge!', '2007-11-28 23:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275120, 616182, 23002, '<td valign="top">Wow, you sharpened all these, then actually dulled the ends a bit, that is dedication!  The white one stands out nicely. 7</td>', 'Wow, you sharpened all these, then actually dulled the ends a bit, that is dedication!  The white one stands out nicely. 7', '2007-11-28 23:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275124, 617220, 23002, '<td valign="top">A greater depth of field would have helped this.  I just got rid of all my cassettes last year. ;)</td>', 'A greater depth of field would have helped this.  I just got rid of all my cassettes last year. ;)', '2007-11-28 23:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275127, 615846, 23002, '<td valign="top">It is a shame this is basic editing so you could not darken the faceless girl behind her.  Great shot though.</td>', 'It is a shame this is basic editing so you could not darken the faceless girl behind her.  Great shot though.', '2007-11-28 23:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275132, 617439, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like the grain in this image, but the blueberry is a bit too centered for my liking.  What does it look like in colour?  It lacks a bit of impact in greyscale.</td>', 'I like the grain in this image, but the blueberry is a bit too centered for my liking.  What does it look like in colour?  It lacks a bit of impact in greyscale.', '2007-11-28 23:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275135, 617513, 23002, '<td valign="top">The vibrant colours are wonderful.  But how can they be alone when there are 3 of them?</td>', 'The vibrant colours are wonderful.  But how can they be alone when there are 3 of them?', '2007-11-28 23:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275137, 615619, 23002, '<td valign="top">I can see the alone, but not the crowd.  Has anyone seen the crowd?</td>', 'I can see the alone, but not the crowd.  Has anyone seen the crowd?', '2007-11-28 23:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275139, 616276, 23002, '<td valign="top">Despite the cliched title, it is an interesting colour study.  I would like to see it with better DOF though.</td>', 'Despite the cliched title, it is an interesting colour study.  I would like to see it with better DOF though.', '2007-11-28 23:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275140, 616674, 23002, '<td valign="top">Well, it certainly has a crowd, and she is alone with her sign.  Nicely taken with a shutter speed that blurs the fast walkers, but not the main subject that is not moving very much.  Well done, a great fit for the challenge. 7</td>', 'Well, it certainly has a crowd, and she is alone with her sign.  Nicely taken with a shutter speed that blurs the fast walkers, but not the main subject that is not moving very much.  Well done, a great fit for the challenge. 7', '2007-11-28 23:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275144, 616774, 23002, '<td valign="top">The grain does not help this image at all.  The fence is very distracting.  Your idea is good, but it just did not come together in this shot. Keep shooting!</td>', 'The grain does not help this image at all.  The fence is very distracting.  Your idea is good, but it just did not come together in this shot. Keep shooting!', '2007-11-28 23:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
