(4275147, 616422, 23002, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well.  Is she a lonely double fist drinking lady, or waiting for her friend?  Either way she is not part of the crowd in this shot. Nicely seen.</td>', 'Fits the challenge well.  Is she a lonely double fist drinking lady, or waiting for her friend?  Either way she is not part of the crowd in this shot. Nicely seen.', '2007-11-28 23:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
