(4275686, 617402, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the technicals, but bonus point for lateral thinking.  Should have made us guess the title ;-)</td>', 'Not really fond of the technicals, but bonus point for lateral thinking.  Should have made us guess the title ;-)', '2007-11-29 08:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
