(4275711, 615579, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Very unique pose on that guy on the right.  For the challenge, it would have been better if the 2 in similar positions were also the same color.  I don''t know if it would have been possible to desat those two ... kinda'' hard in Basic but might have worked since the guy on the end has a lot of yellow and the others don''t.  Or maybe just pump up the saturation on yellow to really make him pop out.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Very unique pose on that guy on the right.  For the challenge, it would have been better if the 2 in similar positions were also the same color.  I don''t know if it would have been possible to desat those two ... kinda'' hard in Basic but might have worked since the guy on the end has a lot of yellow and the others don''t.  Or maybe just pump up the saturation on yellow to really make him pop out.', '2007-11-29 08:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275718, 615856, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, you gave it a little face!  Not sure I like two different colors of beads as his crowd as much as I would have liked one, but he definitely stands out.</td>', 'Aw, you gave it a little face!  Not sure I like two different colors of beads as his crowd as much as I would have liked one, but he definitely stands out.', '2007-11-29 08:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275725, 616272, 65234, '<td valign="top">This belongs on a t-shirt, *with* the title.  Bonus point for a morning giggle.  Might like a bit more space on top of the leaf but overall composition makes your point nicely, as your DOF kept enought detail to see that there are flakes.</td>', 'This belongs on a t-shirt, *with* the title.  Bonus point for a morning giggle.  Might like a bit more space on top of the leaf but overall composition makes your point nicely, as your DOF kept enought detail to see that there are flakes.', '2007-11-29 08:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275742, 617493, 65234, '<td valign="top">That whisk is adorable.  I really like how the eggs surround him but maintain much more space around him than from each other.  He does have an out; perhaps he should take it ;-)  Very nicely lit shot, in addition to the careful composition.  Only nit is a speck of something on the bottom of the 2nd egg from the right that needs scraping off.</td>', 'That whisk is adorable.  I really like how the eggs surround him but maintain much more space around him than from each other.  He does have an out; perhaps he should take it ;-)  Very nicely lit shot, in addition to the careful composition.  Only nit is a speck of something on the bottom of the 2nd egg from the right that needs scraping off.', '2007-11-29 09:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275749, 616182, 65234, '<td valign="top">By far the best of the pencil/crayon/marker shots.  Feels incredibly crowded by the similarities of all those brown pencils, every last one of them in focus, and then the white one just jumps right out as being different.  Perfectly illustrates the challenge concept, IMO.</td>', 'By far the best of the pencil/crayon/marker shots.  Feels incredibly crowded by the similarities of all those brown pencils, every last one of them in focus, and then the white one just jumps right out as being different.  Perfectly illustrates the challenge concept, IMO.', '2007-11-29 09:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275755, 616090, 65234, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF!  The green one would have stood out anyway but gets extra oomph from the focus.  I like the curvy line of the composition.  Nit: there''s a little too much space on top; it feels like it would be better balanced if the pins in the back were at a sharper angle instead of straightening out.</td>', 'Perfect DOF!  The green one would have stood out anyway but gets extra oomph from the focus.  I like the curvy line of the composition.  Nit: there''s a little too much space on top; it feels like it would be better balanced if the pins in the back were at a sharper angle instead of straightening out.', '2007-11-29 09:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275761, 616155, 65234, '<td valign="top">This illustrates the challange nicely and is also a lovely shot with the frost on the leaves.  One of those shots that gets better and better the longer I look at it :-)</td>', 'This illustrates the challange nicely and is also a lovely shot with the frost on the leaves.  One of those shots that gets better and better the longer I look at it :-)', '2007-11-29 09:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275766, 617143, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great shot for the challenge, and great shot in its own right.</td>', 'Great shot for the challenge, and great shot in its own right.', '2007-11-29 09:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275777, 615726, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love the look on her face!  She has spied her unsuspecting victim.  Probably just to give him a menu or ask, "How ya'' doin'' honey?  More pie?" but some kind of interaction is clearly about to occur.</td>', 'Oh, I love the look on her face!  She has spied her unsuspecting victim.  Probably just to give him a menu or ask, "How ya'' doin'' honey?  More pie?" but some kind of interaction is clearly about to occur.', '2007-11-29 09:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275778, 617219, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great title :-)))  Nice composition, lighting, DOF, and great concept for the challenge.</td>', 'Great title :-)))  Nice composition, lighting, DOF, and great concept for the challenge.', '2007-11-29 09:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275780, 617516, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, subtle way to make the point.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, subtle way to make the point.', '2007-11-29 09:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275782, 616218, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s sad.  His slumped body language and hidden face contribute mightily to the mood, and your title is perfect.</td>', 'That''s sad.  His slumped body language and hidden face contribute mightily to the mood, and your title is perfect.', '2007-11-29 09:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275787, 617363, 65234, '<td valign="top">Unique POV and excellent photo for this challenge.  Her expression and her being withdrawn in her hood is perfect for conveying a kid who doesn''t feel she''s part of what''s happening around her.</td>', 'Unique POV and excellent photo for this challenge.  Her expression and her being withdrawn in her hood is perfect for conveying a kid who doesn''t feel she''s part of what''s happening around her.', '2007-11-29 09:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275791, 616392, 65234, '<td valign="top">I see Santa is given a wide berth.  Great shot :-)</td>', 'I see Santa is given a wide berth.  Great shot :-)', '2007-11-29 09:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275803, 617256, 55956, '<td valign="top">great image. as personal opinion the black and white is beautiful, the drops of light on the heads of the people are perfect to remember me the presence of the peoples without the peoples. the backlighting with the fountain is fantastic.10</td>', 'great image. as personal opinion the black and white is beautiful, the drops of light on the heads of the people are perfect to remember me the presence of the peoples without the peoples. the backlighting with the fountain is fantastic.10', '2007-11-29 09:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275805, 617382, 48086, '<td valign="top">nice concept, yet the execution is a bit lacking. the harsh lighting distracts, pov not too interesting. good use of colors 7</td>', 'nice concept, yet the execution is a bit lacking. the harsh lighting distracts, pov not too interesting. good use of colors 7', '2007-11-29 09:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275811, 616376, 48086, '<td valign="top">idea is good enough, but the light is flat and uninteresting. strange oof softness doesnt enhance the picture. not enough contrast</td>', 'idea is good enough, but the light is flat and uninteresting. strange oof softness doesnt enhance the picture. not enough contrast', '2007-11-29 09:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275817, 615712, 48086, '<td valign="top">emotive face, but lack of sharpness ruins the picture. with the other peoples heads, probably family, in the picture this would be so much better</td>', 'emotive face, but lack of sharpness ruins the picture. with the other peoples heads, probably family, in the picture this would be so much better', '2007-11-29 09:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275821, 617349, 65234, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to like about this.  At first glance I thought the spectator had her head turned in the same direction as the portraits, but then realized that was an optical illusion of sorts.  Kudos on getting just the right angle to do that.  The painting looks cockeyed and the horizon isn''t level, but somehow that isn''t bothering me, and the frame echoing the portrait frame is a nice touch.  My first inclination was to say her posterior should be cropped out, but on reflection everything about her - fuschia sweater, too-tight pants, oddly magenta tint in her hair - is sort of the antithesis of the noble, gently lit, subtle tones of a Rockwell.  She doesn''t belong with those she contemplates.  I wonder what she was thinking?</td>', 'There is a lot to like about this.  At first glance I thought the spectator had her head turned in the same direction as the portraits, but then realized that was an optical illusion of sorts.  Kudos on getting just the right angle to do that.  The painting looks cockeyed and the horizon isn''t level, but somehow that isn''t bothering me, and the frame echoing the portrait frame is a nice touch.  My first inclination was to say her posterior should be cropped out, but on reflection everything about her - fuschia sweater, too-tight pants, oddly magenta tint in her hair - is sort of the antithesis of the noble, gently lit, subtle tones of a Rockwell.  She doesn''t belong with those she contemplates.  I wonder what she was thinking?', '2007-11-29 09:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275824, 616178, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely sentiment, very nicely conveyed.  Lighting, DOF and POV all enhance the image.</td>', 'Lovely sentiment, very nicely conveyed.  Lighting, DOF and POV all enhance the image.', '2007-11-29 09:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275831, 617409, 65234, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the candy shots (don''t you hate it when a bunch of other people have similar ideas?).  The blatant differentness of the blue M&amp;M works nicely to convey the challenge topic, and I like its placement in the frame.</td>', 'My favorite of the candy shots (don''t you hate it when a bunch of other people have similar ideas?).  The blatant differentness of the blue M&M works nicely to convey the challenge topic, and I like its placement in the frame.', '2007-11-29 09:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275832, 616218, 10071, '<td valign="top">This means so much to all.  The image reminds me that we are not invisable and we will always leave behind something to be thought about in the future.</td>', 'This means so much to all.  The image reminds me that we are not invisable and we will always leave behind something to be thought about in the future.', '2007-11-29 09:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4275835, 617516, 48086, '<td valign="top">great picture, just not on subject for me. like the colors and sharpness. has a nice goofy aspect to it</td>', 'great picture, just not on subject for me. like the colors and sharpness. has a nice goofy aspect to it', '2007-11-29 09:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
