(4275878, 615855, 48086, '<td valign="top">great shot and topic, but somehow doesnt convince. the 75 girl is a bit distracting perhaps a more focussed crop on the guy and the looking child would enhance it. colors actually distract here try bw</td>', 'great shot and topic, but somehow doesnt convince. the 75 girl is a bit distracting perhaps a more focussed crop on the guy and the looking child would enhance it. colors actually distract here try bw', '2007-11-29 09:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
