(4276300, 617516, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey, now that I know it''s yours, I''ll give you a comment. I''d already scored it with a 7, which I''ll keep as I gave it to you before I knew it was a Critical Mass member''s. It''s clever, and it does meet the challenge. It reminds me of those IQ tests where you have to find the odd one out. I understand why you chose to keep all the gelatin colors the same, though I think making the "odd one out" a different color might help drive the point home. Anyway, kudos for your creativity! And great lighting, BTW.</td>', 'Jeffrey, now that I know it''s yours, I''ll give you a comment. I''d already scored it with a 7, which I''ll keep as I gave it to you before I knew it was a Critical Mass member''s. It''s clever, and it does meet the challenge. It reminds me of those IQ tests where you have to find the odd one out. I understand why you chose to keep all the gelatin colors the same, though I think making the "odd one out" a different color might help drive the point home. Anyway, kudos for your creativity! And great lighting, BTW.', '2007-11-29 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
