(4276555, 616633, 68586, '<td valign="top">If the black guy in the middle is begging and being ignored, then this meets the challenge perfectly - the only issue is that it took me a while to figure it out because at first I thought he was just walking along with a coffee cup like the guy to his left. Then it didn''t make sense.<br/> <br/>But I''m there now  :-  )<br/> <br/>Wonderful crowd scene - not just a few bodies around him, but stretching down out of sight, and across the other side of the road as well.<br/> <br/>This has got lot''s of really good elements to it - great crop, wonderful mix of expressions, conveys the hustle and bustle of a major city superbly - the only downsides are 1) a little bit noisy (but not a big issue) and 2) the guy just doesn''t quite stand out enough for me, at first glance he is part of the crowd, rather than aolne in it.<br/> <br/>Otherwise really good shot.</td>', 'If the black guy in the middle is begging and being ignored, then this meets the challenge perfectly - the only issue is that it took me a while to figure it out because at first I thought he was just walking along with a coffee cup like the guy to his left. Then it didn''t make sense. But I''m there now  :-  ) Wonderful crowd scene - not just a few bodies around him, but stretching down out of sight, and across the other side of the road as well. This has got lot''s of really good elements to it - great crop, wonderful mix of expressions, conveys the hustle and bustle of a major city superbly - the only downsides are 1) a little bit noisy (but not a big issue) and 2) the guy just doesn''t quite stand out enough for me, at first glance he is part of the crowd, rather than aolne in it. Otherwise really good shot.', '2007-11-29 15:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
