(4276563, 617022, 68586, '<td valign="top">Struggling to see the crowd here . .<br/> <br/>Maybe you know more about this situation than the viewer does ? For all I know the red brick wall behind her might be the outside of a stadium that has 10,000 people in it . . but the problem is for me that it might also just be a brick wall. So I''m without a crowd for her to be alone in. Sorry.</td>', 'Struggling to see the crowd here . . Maybe you know more about this situation than the viewer does ? For all I know the red brick wall behind her might be the outside of a stadium that has 10,000 people in it . . but the problem is for me that it might also just be a brick wall. So I''m without a crowd for her to be alone in. Sorry.', '2007-11-29 15:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
