(4276575, 617244, 68586, '<td valign="top">Well he''s certainly in one huge crowd - the question is whether he is alone in it? or the centre of everyones attention - an almost messianic figure with one arm thrust heavenwards and a sea of hands reaching imploringly towards him. <br/> <br/>He has become their focal point - The crowd want to embrace and assimilate him as their own. Which for me doesnt really convey the feeling of being alone.<br/> <br/>Nice shot though - and great moment to capture.</td>', 'Well he''s certainly in one huge crowd - the question is whether he is alone in it? or the centre of everyones attention - an almost messianic figure with one arm thrust heavenwards and a sea of hands reaching imploringly towards him.  He has become their focal point - The crowd want to embrace and assimilate him as their own. Which for me doesnt really convey the feeling of being alone. Nice shot though - and great moment to capture.', '2007-11-29 15:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
