(4276836, 617516, 67553, '<td valign="top">Um. . . I''m gonna go with solidified jello.  The good news is that you got me to sit here and stare at your image for a long time.  The better news is that you got me to come back later and stare it it some more.  After I had my brilliant (Doesn''t matter if I''m right or not, it''s still brilliant!) idea of how this was done, I was able to sit back and enjoy the quality of the lighting you used, the sharpness of the image overall, and the wonderfully warm colors.  This is my pick for the blue!  Well done!</td>', 'Um. . . I''m gonna go with solidified jello.  The good news is that you got me to sit here and stare at your image for a long time.  The better news is that you got me to come back later and stare it it some more.  After I had my brilliant (Doesn''t matter if I''m right or not, it''s still brilliant!) idea of how this was done, I was able to sit back and enjoy the quality of the lighting you used, the sharpness of the image overall, and the wonderfully warm colors.  This is my pick for the blue!  Well done!', '2007-11-29 17:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4276840, 617439, 67553, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that B&amp;W was the way to go with this concept.</td>', 'I''m not sure that B&W was the way to go with this concept.', '2007-11-29 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4276846, 617233, 86334, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the layout of the ugly leaves is kinda distracting.</td>', 'Great idea but the layout of the ugly leaves is kinda distracting.', '2007-11-29 17:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4276850, 617411, 67553, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo.  I think I would have put the apple in front, to give it a more prominent position, though.</td>', 'This is a cute photo.  I think I would have put the apple in front, to give it a more prominent position, though.', '2007-11-29 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4276854, 615856, 86334, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but the clay seems more out of place than alone amongst the  plastic beads. Makes more sense with beads of a natural material. Also, is it coincidence that the black and white beads are paired? Couples?</td>', 'Interesting idea but the clay seems more out of place than alone amongst the  plastic beads. Makes more sense with beads of a natural material. Also, is it coincidence that the black and white beads are paired? Couples?', '2007-11-29 17:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4276862, 617349, 86334, '<td valign="top">Great idea. You also did a fine job mimicking the lighting in the painting. A tighter crop to eliminate the distracting floor and purse would have gone far.</td>', 'Great idea. You also did a fine job mimicking the lighting in the painting. A tighter crop to eliminate the distracting floor and purse would have gone far.', '2007-11-29 17:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
