(4277123, 616833, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is tough for me to vote and comment ''cause I know how hard these little devils are to capture. I would have liked to see a little better DOF in the foreground. A nice capture of the hummer though!</td>', 'This is tough for me to vote and comment ''cause I know how hard these little devils are to capture. I would have liked to see a little better DOF in the foreground. A nice capture of the hummer though!', '2007-11-29 20:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
