(4277611, 615846, 49578, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice shot. I like the composition.<br/>The white looks overexposed, though and the "alone in a crowd" feeling does not seem to be conveyed very convincingly</td>', 'That''s a nice shot. I like the composition.The white looks overexposed, though and the "alone in a crowd" feeling does not seem to be conveyed very convincingly', '2007-11-30 02:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277612, 617335, 49578, '<td valign="top">The subject is neither well lit nor compositionally at a strong point</td>', 'The subject is neither well lit nor compositionally at a strong point', '2007-11-30 02:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277613, 615935, 49578, '<td valign="top">I think your compositions does it all. I like this one a lot</td>', 'I think your compositions does it all. I like this one a lot', '2007-11-30 02:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277615, 617384, 49578, '<td valign="top">Does not do justice to the theme, and nothing special about lighting</td>', 'Does not do justice to the theme, and nothing special about lighting', '2007-11-30 02:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277616, 617060, 49578, '<td valign="top">he he he, very amusing and cute</td>', 'he he he, very amusing and cute', '2007-11-30 02:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277617, 617233, 49578, '<td valign="top">I like how the red stands out from the dried leafs'' brown</td>', 'I like how the red stands out from the dried leafs'' brown', '2007-11-30 02:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277618, 617516, 49578, '<td valign="top">wow! nice lighting and a cool idea</td>', 'wow! nice lighting and a cool idea', '2007-11-30 02:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277619, 616958, 49578, '<td valign="top">The concept and composition is good, but things are bad with exposuer and colour. The colours look too harsh and saturated</td>', 'The concept and composition is good, but things are bad with exposuer and colour. The colours look too harsh and saturated', '2007-11-30 02:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277623, 617391, 49578, '<td valign="top">It is very difficult to decide what the subject is in this picture, if you do not read the title. The car itself is not very nicely exposed and there are too many distracting elements in the picture</td>', 'It is very difficult to decide what the subject is in this picture, if you do not read the title. The car itself is not very nicely exposed and there are too many distracting elements in the picture', '2007-11-30 02:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277626, 617363, 49578, '<td valign="top">Your model must have had a tough time standing steady! nice capture</td>', 'Your model must have had a tough time standing steady! nice capture', '2007-11-30 02:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277629, 615856, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like the setup.  Maybe it''s my memories from preschool, but there is just something disturbing about seeing clay on (felt? carpet?).  All those stray fibers get in and ruin the clay!  Regardless, it''s a unique take on the challenge and well executed--7</td>', 'I like the setup.  Maybe it''s my memories from preschool, but there is just something disturbing about seeing clay on (felt? carpet?).  All those stray fibers get in and ruin the clay!  Regardless, it''s a unique take on the challenge and well executed--7', '2007-11-30 02:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277631, 615727, 84520, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. I think it would have worked better if the other leaves were the same color--yellow or brown.  Also, the border seems a little too wide, 10 pixels is usually enought for the effect without distracting from the image itself</td>', 'I love the idea. I think it would have worked better if the other leaves were the same color--yellow or brown.  Also, the border seems a little too wide, 10 pixels is usually enought for the effect without distracting from the image itself', '2007-11-30 02:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277636, 617341, 84520, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  You could have a better depth of sharpness with a prime focus lens like a 50mm and a high, narrow aperture.  Currently, it looks like the back 1/3 of the image is slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Great idea.  You could have a better depth of sharpness with a prime focus lens like a 50mm and a high, narrow aperture.  Currently, it looks like the back 1/3 of the image is slightly out of focus.', '2007-11-30 02:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277640, 617266, 84520, '<td valign="top">I think this would work better if the different fish was either in the center.  The mass of fish to the right draws the eye away from the different fish, and it took me a few seconds to see where he was.</td>', 'I think this would work better if the different fish was either in the center.  The mass of fish to the right draws the eye away from the different fish, and it took me a few seconds to see where he was.', '2007-11-30 02:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277641, 617336, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but it seems like your highlights are washed out.  I would go dor a shadow/highlights mask to tease out the midtone detail.  Also, the box on the bottom and the right is destracting--you should crop it out</td>', 'I like the idea but it seems like your highlights are washed out.  I would go dor a shadow/highlights mask to tease out the midtone detail.  Also, the box on the bottom and the right is destracting--you should crop it out', '2007-11-30 02:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277642, 616504, 84520, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a fisheye lens, and the black and white looks great.  Part of me wishes that there was more shadow detail in the older woman''s coat, and the baby''s carrage.  And in the market.   But that may not have been your intent--7</td>', 'Nice use of a fisheye lens, and the black and white looks great.  Part of me wishes that there was more shadow detail in the older woman''s coat, and the baby''s carrage.  And in the market.   But that may not have been your intent--7', '2007-11-30 02:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277643, 616504, 49578, '<td valign="top">so sweet!</td>', 'so sweet!', '2007-11-30 02:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277644, 617517, 84520, '<td valign="top">Nice!  It would have looked cool if you had circled the skittle with rings of m&amp;m''s of the same color--an orange ring, then a blue ring, then red etc.  Regardless, its a good idea and is well executed.</td>', 'Nice!  It would have looked cool if you had circled the skittle with rings of m&m''s of the same color--an orange ring, then a blue ring, then red etc.  Regardless, its a good idea and is well executed.', '2007-11-30 03:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277646, 617402, 84520, '<td valign="top">Heh.  The ''d'' in the upper right is out of focus, as is the ''cr'' in the right crowd.  Next time, I would go for a better depth of sharpness, and some stronger lighting would also be helpful.  Finally, the table on the top and the right is destracting, and should either be cropped out or excluded from the composition.</td>', 'Heh.  The ''d'' in the upper right is out of focus, as is the ''cr'' in the right crowd.  Next time, I would go for a better depth of sharpness, and some stronger lighting would also be helpful.  Finally, the table on the top and the right is destracting, and should either be cropped out or excluded from the composition.', '2007-11-30 03:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277647, 616178, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like the HDR effect on the penny''s, and the idea is really cool.  However, the blank spaces on the top and bottom are destracting, and you''d be better off continuing the line of pennys--the depth of focus will keep them from being destracting, but will fill the image--7</td>', 'I like the HDR effect on the penny''s, and the idea is really cool.  However, the blank spaces on the top and bottom are destracting, and you''d be better off continuing the line of pennys--the depth of focus will keep them from being destracting, but will fill the image--7', '2007-11-30 03:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277648, 616633, 84520, '<td valign="top">Post processing seems a little harsh, and the highlights are too washed out in the background.  Also, I can see three other black people in the image so he''s not exactly alone in a crowd.  It would work better to have a model stand for you, and do a timed exposure.  Then, you would have your dude isolated not only by your composition but by his race.  See <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=596225" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/752/120/596225.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/752/120/596225.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/752/120/596225.jpg"/></a> for a good example of what I''m talking about</td>', 'Post processing seems a little harsh, and the highlights are too washed out in the background.  Also, I can see three other black people in the image so he''s not exactly alone in a crowd.  It would work better to have a model stand for you, and do a timed exposure.  Then, you would have your dude isolated not only by your composition but by his race.  See  for a good example of what I''m talking about', '2007-11-30 03:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4277649, 617204, 84520, '<td valign="top">This is great.  Its something I can relate to, and it involves peanut m&amp;m''s, which are my passion in life (well not really, but are still delicious).    The border is a bit too thick for my tastes, 10 pixels is usually enough--8</td>', 'This is great.  Its something I can relate to, and it involves peanut m&m''s, which are my passion in life (well not really, but are still delicious).    The border is a bit too thick for my tastes, 10 pixels is usually enough--8', '2007-11-30 03:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
