(4281989, 617335, 61788, '<td valign="top">he''s definitely alone in a crowd, but his position in a frame does not really attract attention. I think it was possible to place camera closer or maybe used longer shutter speed (since he''s static) and increase blur of movement of crowd, or some other way increase the attention to him and separate from crowd visually</td>', 'he''s definitely alone in a crowd, but his position in a frame does not really attract attention. I think it was possible to place camera closer or maybe used longer shutter speed (since he''s static) and increase blur of movement of crowd, or some other way increase the attention to him and separate from crowd visually', '2007-12-02 05:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
