(4283168, 616833, 68586, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea, but the bird tends to get lost in the picture as it is so small and you don''t seem to have used the maximum image size either, which makes everything smaller again.<br/> <br/>In an ideal world if you could have got essentially the same shot but the bird with a bit of sun lighting up it''s plumage, in among the flowers (so they formed the backdrop instead of the fence) and cropped it in a bit tighter I think this could have been a really eyecatching shot.<br/> <br/>but hey - wildlife and weather rarely co-operate  :-  )</td>', 'not a bad idea, but the bird tends to get lost in the picture as it is so small and you don''t seem to have used the maximum image size either, which makes everything smaller again. In an ideal world if you could have got essentially the same shot but the bird with a bit of sun lighting up it''s plumage, in among the flowers (so they formed the backdrop instead of the fence) and cropped it in a bit tighter I think this could have been a really eyecatching shot. but hey - wildlife and weather rarely co-operate  :-  )', '2007-12-02 16:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283172, 615846, 68586, '<td valign="top">quite a nice portrait, but it''s hard to really see the crowd, and very odd has happened to the face of the girl behind her which is a little distracting. Quite a nice capture of the main girl though and I like the B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'quite a nice portrait, but it''s hard to really see the crowd, and very odd has happened to the face of the girl behind her which is a little distracting. Quite a nice capture of the main girl though and I like the B&W conversion.', '2007-12-02 16:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283181, 617204, 87294, '<td valign="top">Great idea, love the colour.</td>', 'Great idea, love the colour.', '2007-12-02 16:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283182, 617214, 68586, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry if I''m being a bit thick here - but I''m really struggling to see what''s alone here, and what crowd it''s alone from ?<br/> <br/>I did wonder if it was the metal winch - but there are other metal tools on the wall . . and I wondered if it was the wooden tub in the middle but there are two other tubs as well . . Interesting workshop though.</td>', 'I''m sorry if I''m being a bit thick here - but I''m really struggling to see what''s alone here, and what crowd it''s alone from ? I did wonder if it was the metal winch - but there are other metal tools on the wall . . and I wondered if it was the wooden tub in the middle but there are two other tubs as well . . Interesting workshop though.', '2007-12-02 16:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283188, 617255, 68586, '<td valign="top">you''ve certainly captured the alone - but I''m not sure about the crowd - I think you really neede to include more than just their legs.</td>', 'you''ve certainly captured the alone - but I''m not sure about the crowd - I think you really neede to include more than just their legs.', '2007-12-02 16:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
