(4283695, 616218, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very poignant &amp; insightful interpretation of the challenge.  I would prefer to see the stone the veteran is facing and peraps place him back further amongst the stones.  Perhaps you were trying to assure his cap was legible, but I think the context (particularly with the title) is easy to understand.  Thanks for a very thought provoking entry.</td>', 'Very poignant & insightful interpretation of the challenge.  I would prefer to see the stone the veteran is facing and peraps place him back further amongst the stones.  Perhaps you were trying to assure his cap was legible, but I think the context (particularly with the title) is easy to understand.  Thanks for a very thought provoking entry.', '2007-12-02 20:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283707, 617143, 41780, '<td valign="top">great job</td>', 'great job', '2007-12-02 20:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283739, 617143, 83080, '<td valign="top">This is the technique I was going to use if I had time to enter this challenge.  I think the subject would look more alone if she was not looking at the camera.  I wonder what it would look like to use this concept looking down on the model (like looking down on her in a mall lobby or an airport from the the next floor above).  Nice job.  I was hoping to see a picture like yours.</td>', 'This is the technique I was going to use if I had time to enter this challenge.  I think the subject would look more alone if she was not looking at the camera.  I wonder what it would look like to use this concept looking down on the model (like looking down on her in a mall lobby or an airport from the the next floor above).  Nice job.  I was hoping to see a picture like yours.', '2007-12-02 21:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283802, 617060, 83080, '<td valign="top">Fun interpretation.  The black background blends in undesireable ways with the black in the animals &amp; leggings for me.  With the black, I might have pulled the snake around enough to keep it''s face from dissappearing.  Also, the girls left foot looks creepily detached :)  I love the expression you caught on her.  How long were you able to keep her posing happily amongst the animals for you?  Well done.</td>', 'Fun interpretation.  The black background blends in undesireable ways with the black in the animals & leggings for me.  With the black, I might have pulled the snake around enough to keep it''s face from dissappearing.  Also, the girls left foot looks creepily detached :)  I love the expression you caught on her.  How long were you able to keep her posing happily amongst the animals for you?  Well done.', '2007-12-02 21:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283834, 617367, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I think I would have tried to have only one person (actually alone) in the shot to emphasize the spirit of this challenge.  Also I might have cropped in closer for a stronger juxtaposition of the person &amp; the city.</td>', 'Great idea.  I think I would have tried to have only one person (actually alone) in the shot to emphasize the spirit of this challenge.  Also I might have cropped in closer for a stronger juxtaposition of the person & the city.', '2007-12-02 21:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283877, 617204, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very funny.  I wish you had used a sexier peanut ;)  The few holes where the backlighting is uninterrupted are a bit distracting.  Overall very affective.  So, did you get that peanut by eating the rest of an m&amp;m or did you have an unadulterated peanut supply at your disposal?</td>', 'Very funny.  I wish you had used a sexier peanut ;)  The few holes where the backlighting is uninterrupted are a bit distracting.  Overall very affective.  So, did you get that peanut by eating the rest of an m&m or did you have an unadulterated peanut supply at your disposal?', '2007-12-02 21:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283893, 617363, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I just got through recommending to the other person that entered one like this to try looking down on the subject.  A little more contrast and more interesting background might help this shot.  It conveys the challenge very well.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very nice.  I just got through recommending to the other person that entered one like this to try looking down on the subject.  A little more contrast and more interesting background might help this shot.  It conveys the challenge very well.  Nice job!', '2007-12-02 21:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
