(4285168, 617143, 72929, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this idea wasn''t used more for this challenge. Having the subject stand still for a long exposure in the middle of people traffic is my first idea of "alone in a crowd". Tehcnically this is good, although I don''t care aesthetically for the blue-steel look.</td>', 'I''m surprised this idea wasn''t used more for this challenge. Having the subject stand still for a long exposure in the middle of people traffic is my first idea of "alone in a crowd". Tehcnically this is good, although I don''t care aesthetically for the blue-steel look.', '2007-12-03 09:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
