(4287011, 617516, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, lighting is good along with focus and colors but I''m finding it hard to relate the photo to the challenge. I know the two left and the two right glasses are different but it just don''t click.</td>', 'Nice photograph, lighting is good along with focus and colors but I''m finding it hard to relate the photo to the challenge. I know the two left and the two right glasses are different but it just don''t click.', '2007-12-03 22:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
