(4288007, 617335, 76430, '<td valign="top">Japan has some beautiful and really contrasting scenery.  I''ve never seen a picture of someone sleeping on the street.  This would be normal in NYC, but not here.  Good shot but there are a lot of distractions other than the crowd that grabbed my attention, so it took some time to find the subject.  I think cropping everything from the Kirin tent and right would help.</td>', 'Japan has some beautiful and really contrasting scenery.  I''ve never seen a picture of someone sleeping on the street.  This would be normal in NYC, but not here.  Good shot but there are a lot of distractions other than the crowd that grabbed my attention, so it took some time to find the subject.  I think cropping everything from the Kirin tent and right would help.', '2007-12-04 10:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
