(4288288, 616422, 71765, '<td valign="top">Suggestions:<br/>- Subject should probably be ''entering'' the photo, ''leaving'' the photo (face subject towards center of photo) for more interesting composition.<br/>- The camera should have been angled down a bit more to capture more of the surroundings and less of the ceiling, and position the subject so her face is a bit higher in the frame.<br/>- Use a softer focus and shallower depth of field to dramatize her being disconnected.<br/> <br/>Just my 2 cents.   =-)</td>', 'Suggestions:- Subject should probably be ''entering'' the photo, ''leaving'' the photo (face subject towards center of photo) for more interesting composition.- The camera should have been angled down a bit more to capture more of the surroundings and less of the ceiling, and position the subject so her face is a bit higher in the frame.- Use a softer focus and shallower depth of field to dramatize her being disconnected. Just my 2 cents.   =-)', '2007-12-04 12:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4288290, 617338, 87307, '<td valign="top">nice image, but almost too cartoony</td>', 'nice image, but almost too cartoony', '2007-12-04 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
