(4288376, 616272, 62318, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I see the crowd part on the picture. But beyond that an interesting take on the competition of textures. Since you went with a square crop, I might have preferred the leaf in the center of the frame. I do like the shadow and light play. Maybe emphasize that a bit with a curves adjustment, concentrating more on the shadows?</td>', 'Not sure if I see the crowd part on the picture. But beyond that an interesting take on the competition of textures. Since you went with a square crop, I might have preferred the leaf in the center of the frame. I do like the shadow and light play. Maybe emphasize that a bit with a curves adjustment, concentrating more on the shadows?', '2007-12-04 13:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
