(4288385, 617255, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like how you minimized the impact of the other people by just including their legs and at the same time keeping it critical to the photo. The little wooden post thing seems to mimic the human legs in a pleasing way. Myabe just a bit too much contrast for me (or the white a bit too bright). Nice evocative photo.</td>', 'I like how you minimized the impact of the other people by just including their legs and at the same time keeping it critical to the photo. The little wooden post thing seems to mimic the human legs in a pleasing way. Myabe just a bit too much contrast for me (or the white a bit too bright). Nice evocative photo.', '2007-12-04 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4288386, 617497, 62318, '<td valign="top">Nice color pop with the poster. I might have tried to crop this as an 8x10 so that the grey sky and crane were gone (start with the lease building). Interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice color pop with the poster. I might have tried to crop this as an 8x10 so that the grey sky and crane were gone (start with the lease building). Interesting take on the challenge.', '2007-12-04 13:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
