(4289012, 617368, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the image and it is a different take on the leafs shots compared to others in this challenge. As a personal preference I would drop the (of being  the only young one). It forces the viewer to  have to see the image from one angle instead allowing them to draw their own conclusions. Also it distracts me from looking at the photo.</td>', 'I like the image and it is a different take on the leafs shots compared to others in this challenge. As a personal preference I would drop the (of being  the only young one). It forces the viewer to  have to see the image from one angle instead allowing them to draw their own conclusions. Also it distracts me from looking at the photo.', '2007-12-04 18:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
