(4289512, 617363, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I was thinking of doing something like this, probably in an airport terminal or mall, but never got it done.  I like the introspective stare, hiding under a hoodie, and of course the steady image vs the blurred passers by.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I was thinking of doing something like this, probably in an airport terminal or mall, but never got it done.  I like the introspective stare, hiding under a hoodie, and of course the steady image vs the blurred passers by.', '2007-12-04 22:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
