(4289524, 617367, 76430, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this looks a lot like a snapshot.  I''m not sure if the alone is the adult amongst the kids or the group alone looking at the city.  Too bad it''s not that clear a day.  Good composition.</td>', 'Unfortunately this looks a lot like a snapshot.  I''m not sure if the alone is the adult amongst the kids or the group alone looking at the city.  Too bad it''s not that clear a day.  Good composition.', '2007-12-04 23:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289533, 617143, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I saw another that looked much like this.  Other than motionless vs blurred motion she does not stand out from the others as much as the other photo and I don''t see the hopelessness.  She looks like she has a lot going for her.</td>', 'Good idea.  I saw another that looked much like this.  Other than motionless vs blurred motion she does not stand out from the others as much as the other photo and I don''t see the hopelessness.  She looks like she has a lot going for her.', '2007-12-04 23:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289536, 616218, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I would like to see him looking at tombstones but with this shot I can''t tell that.  Either if you stepped back a ways or had his in the same pose behind some of those headstones it would be better IMHO.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I would like to see him looking at tombstones but with this shot I can''t tell that.  Either if you stepped back a ways or had his in the same pose behind some of those headstones it would be better IMHO.', '2007-12-04 23:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289542, 616774, 76430, '<td valign="top">The chain link fence really detracts from an otherwise pretty picture.  I guess the blue is the alone subject, but it''s right on the edge and is not sharp.</td>', 'The chain link fence really detracts from an otherwise pretty picture.  I guess the blue is the alone subject, but it''s right on the edge and is not sharp.', '2007-12-04 23:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
