(4289553, 617342, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, a sewing bobbin and pin heads?  I''d like to see it sharper.  Maybe with some better lighting it would be better.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, a sewing bobbin and pin heads?  I''d like to see it sharper.  Maybe with some better lighting it would be better.', '2007-12-04 23:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289554, 616182, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  It looks like pencils, but the "wood" looks so coarse, more like a sheaf of grain.  Good placement of the white tip in the thirds.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  It looks like pencils, but the "wood" looks so coarse, more like a sheaf of grain.  Good placement of the white tip in the thirds.', '2007-12-04 23:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289558, 617402, 76430, '<td valign="top">OK, you took the challenge literally.  Cute, but that probably won''t win many people over, and it''s not a very sharp picture.  This may be competing for brown.</td>', 'OK, you took the challenge literally.  Cute, but that probably won''t win many people over, and it''s not a very sharp picture.  This may be competing for brown.', '2007-12-04 23:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289588, 617349, 50695, '<td valign="top">This photo is fun and fascinating on its own, and is even more intriguing in the context of the challenge. The way she becomes part of the painting, or rather, the painting becomes part of her, makes her alone in its crowd. The way her hair becomes his, making him alone... there''s a poignant sort of sharing of aloneness here, something hopeful about it. And then you framed the picture the same way the painting is framed.<br/> <br/>But most of all, it''s unique, original, unlike anything I''ve seen before. So I''m giving you my own personal ribbon, the Posthumous Blue.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This photo is fun and fascinating on its own, and is even more intriguing in the context of the challenge. The way she becomes part of the painting, or rather, the painting becomes part of her, makes her alone in its crowd. The way her hair becomes his, making him alone... there''s a poignant sort of sharing of aloneness here, something hopeful about it. And then you framed the picture the same way the painting is framed. But most of all, it''s unique, original, unlike anything I''ve seen before. So I''m giving you my own personal ribbon, the Posthumous Blue. ', '2007-12-04 23:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289589, 616408, 50695, '<td valign="top">Perfect execution of the challenge, masterful photo with a tremendous depth of field and a depth of interest just as deep. The Posthumous Red Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Perfect execution of the challenge, masterful photo with a tremendous depth of field and a depth of interest just as deep. The Posthumous Red Ribbon for you. ', '2007-12-04 23:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289592, 617256, 50695, '<td valign="top">Love the organic curves, and the challenge conveyed with the minimum information possible, but even in all this darkness you still convey the lusciousness of the fountain. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Love the organic curves, and the challenge conveyed with the minimum information possible, but even in all this darkness you still convey the lusciousness of the fountain. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2007-12-04 23:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
