(4291134, 617143, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely wonderful entry, and both a blessing and a curse for your first shot out of the gate.<br/> <br/>Know now that you *can* do this, so take heart, but always keep this in mind *when* you get smacked around by the voters in the future.<br/> <br/>For the record, I gave this a 9 ''cause I thought this was a spectacular entry!<br/> <br/>Good luck in future challenges and welcome to The Coliseum!!!</td>', 'This is an absolutely wonderful entry, and both a blessing and a curse for your first shot out of the gate. Know now that you *can* do this, so take heart, but always keep this in mind *when* you get smacked around by the voters in the future. For the record, I gave this a 9 ''cause I thought this was a spectacular entry! Good luck in future challenges and welcome to The Coliseum!!!', '2007-12-05 08:50:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291142, 617437, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on Nicole''s face in this shot, a nice mix of insouciance and little girl lost.  For me the black and white worked well, it was just a bit of a shame that the girl with ear muffs skated into the frame beacuse without her I think this would have scored very very well.  Impressive amount of comments means that at least you provoked a reaction (and generally a very good one given you ave score per commenter)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love the expression on Nicole''s face in this shot, a nice mix of insouciance and little girl lost.  For me the black and white worked well, it was just a bit of a shame that the girl with ear muffs skated into the frame beacuse without her I think this would have scored very very well.  Impressive amount of comments means that at least you provoked a reaction (and generally a very good one given you ave score per commenter) ', '2007-12-05 08:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
