(4291428, 617516, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top ten.  Lovely photo.  I didn''t get a chance to vote, but I admit this was too subtle for me.  It wasn''t until reading your comments that I realized one was different from the others!  It would have been more obvious to have the different glass be completely level (rather than rotated), I guess.<br/> <br/>It''s hard to believe your physical set-up was as rough as described because this seems so technically accomplished.  A little more blue and this could have worked for the complimentary colors challenge, too. :-)</td>', 'Congrats on your top ten.  Lovely photo.  I didn''t get a chance to vote, but I admit this was too subtle for me.  It wasn''t until reading your comments that I realized one was different from the others!  It would have been more obvious to have the different glass be completely level (rather than rotated), I guess. It''s hard to believe your physical set-up was as rough as described because this seems so technically accomplished.  A little more blue and this could have worked for the complimentary colors challenge, too. :-)', '2007-12-05 10:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291523, 617143, 24111, '<td valign="top">I have a 17 year old and know the heartache of this one, high school has not gotten any kinder! Excellent job and congrats!</td>', 'I have a 17 year old and know the heartache of this one, high school has not gotten any kinder! Excellent job and congrats!', '2007-12-05 10:24:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291530, 617363, 24111, '<td valign="top">Boy, I relate to first and 2nd place for sure! Yes, high school is hell for many , makes me tear up to look at this. My daughter is in her last year (thank god) and hoping college will be a much kinder place.<br/>Great job on this! Congrats!</td>', 'Boy, I relate to first and 2nd place for sure! Yes, high school is hell for many , makes me tear up to look at this. My daughter is in her last year (thank god) and hoping college will be a much kinder place.Great job on this! Congrats!', '2007-12-05 10:26:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291556, 617143, 15711, '<td valign="top">So glad this did well.  Congratulations.</td>', 'So glad this did well.  Congratulations.', '2007-12-05 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291593, 616182, 41372, '<td valign="top">Love this photo, while I am not a picture taker, I am a huge fan of this site and love to look and try to guess a winner.  I have been right most of the time....yours was the one I chose from this group and put as my background on my desktop at work.<br/> <br/>Great job! Congrats!  I think what I like (from a non-photo person view) is the grain of the pencils along with the symetry of all the black lead just makes the white jump out that much more.  I wish you more ribbons in your future.  Good luck.</td>', 'Love this photo, while I am not a picture taker, I am a huge fan of this site and love to look and try to guess a winner.  I have been right most of the time....yours was the one I chose from this group and put as my background on my desktop at work. Great job! Congrats!  I think what I like (from a non-photo person view) is the grain of the pencils along with the symetry of all the black lead just makes the white jump out that much more.  I wish you more ribbons in your future.  Good luck.', '2007-12-05 10:42:56.000000', NULL, 0),
