(4291773, 617143, 73980, '<td valign="top">Way to go.  Not only 17 but your first submitted photo and your first challenge AND a blue ribbon to boot.  That is something to be proud of.<br/> <br/>Keep it up!</td>', 'Way to go.  Not only 17 but your first submitted photo and your first challenge AND a blue ribbon to boot.  That is something to be proud of. Keep it up!', '2007-12-05 11:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291802, 617402, 27373, '<td valign="top">People are being way too harsh on this photo.  Your technicals could be better, focus and lighting specifically.  But way to think out of the box.  Hope you enter more.</td>', 'People are being way too harsh on this photo.  Your technicals could be better, focus and lighting specifically.  But way to think out of the box.  Hope you enter more.', '2007-12-05 11:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291829, 616218, 39218, '<td valign="top">I think I loved this photo for precisely the reason some others were commenting in a negative fashion.  I like that you CAN''T see whose stone he is looking at, and the fact that you can''t see his face but the body posture evokes grief and almost a moment of silence.  The title is perfect and it is definitely blue ribbon material by my standards.</td>', 'I think I loved this photo for precisely the reason some others were commenting in a negative fashion.  I like that you CAN''T see whose stone he is looking at, and the fact that you can''t see his face but the body posture evokes grief and almost a moment of silence.  The title is perfect and it is definitely blue ribbon material by my standards.', '2007-12-05 11:31:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4291842, 617493, 52549, '<td valign="top">Glad this did so well for you. Great shot!</td>', 'Glad this did so well for you. Great shot!', '2007-12-05 11:34:07.000000', NULL, 0),
