(4292682, 617497, 71990, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jdannels:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shot man, one of my three 10s I gave. bummer to see it finished so low. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for the encouragement, this is my first entry here, gives me motive to try harder next time. I think i showed what i wanted to show, but the picture was not too good technically. Have to learn more of postprocessing, and I also partially agree to the comment made by zclare, take less of the sky, but personally would leave crane in there. All the technical comments were helpful, and others were good for morale. Thank you all<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-05 14:54:40.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by jdannels: Nice shot man, one of my three 10s I gave. bummer to see it finished so low.  Thanks for the encouragement, this is my first entry here, gives me motive to try harder next time. I think i showed what i wanted to show, but the picture was not too good technically. Have to learn more of postprocessing, and I also partially agree to the comment made by zclare, take less of the sky, but personally would leave crane in there. All the technical comments were helpful, and others were good for morale. Thank you all', '2007-12-05 14:51:46.000000', '2007-12-05 14:54:40.000000', 0),
