(4295248, 617256, 14773, '<td valign="top">This took a quick hand and an even quicker eye to capture so well.  I believe shots like this to be what photography''s about....that said, A++++ should''ve ribboned.</td>', 'This took a quick hand and an even quicker eye to capture so well.  I believe shots like this to be what photography''s about....that said, A++++ should''ve ribboned.', '2007-12-06 08:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4296457, 617437, 67697, '<td valign="top">Happy belated birthday to your daughter!  <br/> <br/>I am surprised this scored so low - it''s a good photo!  I looked over the picture first before reading your description, and she caught my eye right away.  I love her expression.  And I think it''s PERFECT in black and white!</td>', 'Happy belated birthday to your daughter!   I am surprised this scored so low - it''s a good photo!  I looked over the picture first before reading your description, and she caught my eye right away.  I love her expression.  And I think it''s PERFECT in black and white!', '2007-12-06 15:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
