(4296951, 617437, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot! I think it is a tough one for the challenge though. I can see your daughter as the intention of the photograph. However, the shot is so good, that really everything in the frame is appealing.Nearly everyone in the frame contributes a significant way to the photo. It''s brillant, I just don''t get that Alone feeling. Cheers are splendid work.</td>', 'I really like this shot! I think it is a tough one for the challenge though. I can see your daughter as the intention of the photograph. However, the shot is so good, that really everything in the frame is appealing.Nearly everyone in the frame contributes a significant way to the photo. It''s brillant, I just don''t get that Alone feeling. Cheers are splendid work.', '2007-12-06 18:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4296960, 617516, 62318, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the finish! You have an amazing ability with visualization and camera know how. It would take me 50,000 shots to even figure this out.</td>', 'Congrats on the finish! You have an amazing ability with visualization and camera know how. It would take me 50,000 shots to even figure this out.', '2007-12-06 18:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4296969, 616389, 62318, '<td valign="top">This really looks like a voyeur to me. :) One thing I really enjoy about this shot, is the painting behind the man. It feels they are almost sneering at him. However, I am not sure your intention was the vendor or the girl. I am guessin the girl, but the title seems to indicate otherwise. Fun take nonetheless.</td>', 'This really looks like a voyeur to me. :) One thing I really enjoy about this shot, is the painting behind the man. It feels they are almost sneering at him. However, I am not sure your intention was the vendor or the girl. I am guessin the girl, but the title seems to indicate otherwise. Fun take nonetheless.', '2007-12-06 18:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4296989, 617266, 62318, '<td valign="top">Terrific catch Deb. That yellow really zings out against the blue. At first I thought it might not be good with the blue negative space in there, but now I understand how well it works with the yellow.</td>', 'Terrific catch Deb. That yellow really zings out against the blue. At first I thought it might not be good with the blue negative space in there, but now I understand how well it works with the yellow.', '2007-12-06 18:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
