(4300938, 616035, 54634, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by OmanOtter:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m very surprised that they have that kind of dancing in Al Ain.  I was told that Al Ain was an especially religiously-conservative place.  We don''t even have that kind of sexy stuff in Muscat. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well Mr.Omer There is a huge diffrence in UAE and Oman, and if u think that is too exposing then I guess u might plan ur next holidays in UAE, cause dude here in Dubai this is so normal , and the skin flicks are on a continious rise, a night out to c the night life and das it u will remember it for a long time.</td>', 'Originally posted by OmanOtter: I''m very surprised that they have that kind of dancing in Al Ain.  I was told that Al Ain was an especially religiously-conservative place.  We don''t even have that kind of sexy stuff in Muscat.   Well Mr.Omer There is a huge diffrence in UAE and Oman, and if u think that is too exposing then I guess u might plan ur next holidays in UAE, cause dude here in Dubai this is so normal , and the skin flicks are on a continious rise, a night out to c the night life and das it u will remember it for a long time.', '2007-12-08 03:58:19.000000', NULL, 0),
